<h2>Appendix B. Reproducing the results</h2>
<p>The repository runs end to end with <code>make all</code>: catalogue validation, audio
download (cached, never committed), detection, caption download and detector validation,
applause features, market data, the event study, the pre-registered analysis, figures,
notebooks and this report. Derived per-second timelines are committed, so every number in
this report can be recomputed from <code>make features study analyze figures report</code>
without downloading any audio.</p>
